<title>USA: Diametrics picks Japanese partner.</title>
<headline>Diametrics picks Japanese partner.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diametrics Medical Inc said on Wednesday it picked  Century Medical Inc as its distribuotion partner for the company's IRMA System and associated products in Japan.</p>
<p>Diametrics develops critical care testing technology.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
